      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The offence NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-IND:17567 2 CRR-1516-2025 was registered under sections 420 & 409 of the IPC and section 6 of the Madhya Pradesh Nikshepako Ke Hiton Ka Sanrakshan Adhiniyam, 2000 against the present petitioner Yatindra Randhar and Sachin Gyaneshwar Dahake and other persons.",
