    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "After investigation, a final report was submitted before the JMFC, Indore under sections 420, 409, 406 of the IPC and section 6 of the Madhya Pradesh Nikshepako Ke Hiton Ka Sanrakshan Adhiniyam, 2000.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
