      "summary_sent_score": 0.2527373135089874
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The case was committed to the court of Sessions and vide impugned order the charges under section 409 r/w section 34 and section 420 r/w section 34 of the IPC were framed against the present petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1718,
      "end": 1920,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "section 409 r",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1808,
          "end": 1821
        },
        {
          "text": "w section 34",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1822,
          "end": 1834
        },
        {
          "text": "section 420 r",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1839,
          "end": 1852
        },
        {
          "text": "w section 34",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1853,
          "end": 1865
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1873,
          "end": 1876
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4239898920059204
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "3. Challenging the framing of charges, this criminal revision has been preferred on the ground that there is no direct financial transactions with the complainants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1921,
      "end": 2086,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32165440917015076
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The investigation revealed that no Yatindra vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 10 July, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/98859963/\n1 complainants directly deposited funds into petitioner Yatindra Randhar's personal accounts.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2087,
      "end": 2326,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Yatindra vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2122,
          "end": 2161
        },
        {
          "text": "10 July, 2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2165,
          "end": 2178
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatindra Randhar",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2289,
          "end": 2305
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22464318573474884
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The only alleged transaction linking the petitioner Yatindra is from one Ravi Solanki, whose amount was later transferred to Comsys Infotech company account demonstrating no personal misappropriation by the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2327,
      "end": 2545,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Yatindra",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2379,
          "end": 2387
        },
        {
          "text": "Ravi Solanki",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2400,
          "end": 2412
        },
        {
          "text": "Comsys Infotech company",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2452,
          "end": 2475
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16842694580554962
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The petitioner himself is a victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2546,
      "end": 2581,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17035411298274994
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "He also invested a substantial amount (approximately Rs.20 lakhs) in Comsys Infotech and Globe 2 Trade companies as per his statement.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2582,
      "end": 2716,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Comsys Infotech",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2651,
          "end": 2666
        },
        {
          "text": "Globe 2 Trade companies",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2671,
          "end": 2694
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2001679539680481
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "His son Amogh Randhar similarly invested money in these companies but did not receive their returns.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2717,
      "end": 2818,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Amogh Randhar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2726,
          "end": 2739
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2553792893886566
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The petitioner is an investor and not an orchestrator of fraud.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2819,
      "end": 2882,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2936226725578308
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The petitioner has no role in managing financial affairs of the companies in question i.e. Comsys Infotech and Globe 2 Trade companies and that were owned and managed by co-accused Sachin Gyaneshwar Dahake.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2883,
      "end": 3089,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Comsys Infotech",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2974,
          "end": 2989
        },
        {
          "text": "Globe 2 Trade companies",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2994,
          "end": 3017
        },
        {
          "text": "Sachin Gyaneshwar Dahake",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3064,
          "end": 3088
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26713141798973083
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "All the NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-IND:17567 3 CRR-1516-2025 accounts and financial dealings of above two companies were under Sachin Gyaneshwar Dahake's control and here is no evidence suggesting that the petitioner has any ownership or decision making authority in these entities.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3090,
      "end": 3376,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3098,
          "end": 3123
        },
        {
          "text": "Sachin Gyaneshwar Dahake",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3221,
          "end": 3245
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25383105874061584
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The petitioner was a regular investor and not a beneficiary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3377,
      "end": 3437,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5452442765235901
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The FIR does not establish that he withdrew any funds or profited from the schemes.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3438,
      "end": 3521,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.48176833987236023
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The petitioner did not conceal or abscond.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3522,
      "end": 3564,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5137103199958801
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "He cooperated with the police in the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3565,
      "end": 3616,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.47963207960128784
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "He voluntarily made available financial records and his investment details demonstrating good faith.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3617,
      "end": 3717,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.517880380153656
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The charges under sections 420 & 409 r/w section 34 of the IPC require active fraudulent intent and criminal breach of trust.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3718,
      "end": 3843,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "sections 420",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3736,
          "end": 3748
        },
        {
          "text": "409 r",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3751,
          "end": 3756
        },
        {
          "text": "w section 34",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3757,
          "end": 3769
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3777,
          "end": 3780
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4983097314834595
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The petitioner neither had managerial position in the alleged fraudulent companies nor induced the complainant to invest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3844,
      "end": 3965,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6318849921226501
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The police investigation itself confirms that accounts used for fraud were in the name of Comsys Infotech and its associated entities and not in the petitioner's name.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3967,
      "end": 4134,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Comsys Infotech",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 4057,
          "end": 4072
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4177011251449585
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "There is contradictions in the witnesses statements regarding investment returns that witnesses stated in their statements under section 161 of the Cr.P.C. Trial court failed to justify the application of section 409 of the IPC against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4135,
      "end": 4386,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "section 161",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4264,
          "end": 4275
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4283,
          "end": 4290
        },
        {
          "text": "section 409",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4340,
          "end": 4351
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4359,
          "end": 4362
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5822145342826843
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "He is not within the purview of the persons required for the application of section 409 of the IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4387,
      "end": 4486,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "section 409",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4463,
          "end": 4474
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4482,
          "end": 4485
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6306965351104736
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "There is no entrustment of property.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4487,
      "end": 4523,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5504351854324341
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "4. Heard.\n5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4525,
      "end": 4537,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21365314722061157
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "State opposed the petition.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4538,
      "end": 4565,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4721762239933014
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "6. Perused the record.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4567,
      "end": 4592,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29384344816207886
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "The duty of Court at the stage of framing of charge is to see whether the ingredients of the offences are available in the material produced NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-IND:17567 4 CRR-1516-2025 before the court or not.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4593,
      "end": 4815,
