      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5586659908294678
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "The contradictions in the statements of the witnesses or sufficiency or truthfulness of the material placed before the Court cannot be examined at the stage of framing the charges.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4816,
      "end": 4996,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.38927215337753296
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "For this limited purpose, the Court may shift the evidence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4997,
      "end": 5056,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40727242827415466
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "The Court has to consider the material only with a view to find out if there is ground for presuming that the accused has committed an offence and not for the purpose of arriving at a definite conclusion.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5057,
      "end": 5261,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5463789701461792
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "\"Presume\"\nmeans if on the basis of material on record, the Court can come to the conclusion that commission of the offence is a probable consequence, then the case for framing of charge exists.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5262,
      "end": 5455,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32193124294281006
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "In the light of above, this Court is examining the framing of charge against the revision petitioner.",
