      "text": "Accordingly, the ground that final report submitted by the Police Station, Palasia, district Indore does not mention the offence of NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-IND:17567 5 CRR-1516-2025 section 409 IPC against the present petitioner has no relevance.",
